hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"17371","Haddathana Abu Abd al-Rahman al-Muqri, haddathana al-Masudi, he said haddathani Abu Amrah, from his father, he said: We came to the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) while we were four persons, and with us was a horse, so he gave each person among us a share, and gave the horse two shares."
